      "traits": [
        "plant"
      ],
      "description": "<p>A creature hit by the nursery crawler's seed Strike must, on its turn, spend an Interact action to remove the seed; any seeds still implanted at the end of the creature's turn begin to sprout, dealing 1d6 Persistent,bleed Damage damage and rendering the seeded creature Clumsy 1 and Off-Guard. Removing a seed after it's sprouted deals 1d4 Piercing Damage damage; removing it before it begins to sprout does no damage. Removed seeds that land in viable soil sprout immediately and grow into new saplings after 1 hour.</p>",
